uasipolynomial-Time-October-5-2026\",\n+      \"priority\": \"C\",\n+      \"class\": \"benchmark-only\",\n+      \"local_role\": \"RL-adjacent stochastic-game route, not an MDP theorem\",\n+      \"upstream_verification\": {\n+        \"status\": \"manuscript-only-in-current-audit\"\n+      },\n+      \"next_action\": \"audit state/action/transition/policy/player quantifiers and only then decide whether any dynamic-programming or policy lemma is reusable\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"out_of_scope_keyword_matches\": [\n+    \"lean/OAI/Combinatorics/EditApproximation/**/Regret*.lean\"\n+  ],\n+  \"hard_guards\": [\n+    \"Adjacent online-selection results do not count as bandit or RL theorem completion.\",\n+    \"A static experiment lower bound requires an explicit proved reduction before becoming a bandit/RL lower bound.\",\n+    \"Quantum semantics are owned by QuantumComputinglib/ASPBE at the cross-library boundary.\",\n+    \"No solid graph edge without local compiled evidence.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"execution_order\": [\n+    \"oai-matroid-prophet\",\n+    \"oai-matroid-secretary\",\n+    \"oai-boolean-noise\",\n+    \"oai-soft-channel\",\n+    \"oai-gaussian-information\",\n+    \"oai-gaussian-regression\",\n+    \"oai-memory-precision\",\n+    \"oai-stochastic-mean-payoff-games\"\n+  ]\n+}"},{"sha":"8935055f1ab9da1b9e7ee5a472b81d95c8ff18a9","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/.gitattributes","status":"added","additions":10,"deletions":0,"changes":10,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2F.gitattributes","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2F.gitattributes","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2F.gitattributes?re