%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2FPR221-api.receipt.json?ref=b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@\n+{\n+  \"utc\": \"2026-10-11T07:52:25.906656+00:00\",\n+  \"argv\": [\n+    \"gh\",\n+    \"api\",\n+    \"repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/221\"\n+  ],\n+  \"exit\": 0,\n+  \"stdout_sha256\": \"450ffe4e6fd3ec30ddb2c6ae5448a5dc3d8c284e300ae7fd41ed6bd75f5582a1\",\n+  \"stderr_sha256\": \"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\"\n+}"},{"sha":"e69de29bb2d1d6434b8b29ae775ad8c2e48c5391","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/actual-PR221-delivery-v1/PR221-api.stderr.raw","status":"added","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changes":0,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2FPR221-api.stderr.raw","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2FPR221-api.stderr.raw","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2FPR221-api.stderr.raw?ref=b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8"},{"sha":"ab0f5bc05a8395ad7c5ed5d16d7a1eb87890e405","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/actual-PR221-delivery-v1/PR221-api.stdout.raw","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2FPR221-api.stdout.raw","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2FPR221-api.stdout.raw","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2FPR221-api.stdout.raw?ref=b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/221\",\"id\":4817522787,\"node_id\":\"PR_kwDOTEdTLM8AAAABHyWQYw\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/221\",\"diff_url\":\"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/221.diff\",\"patch_url\":\"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/221.patch\",\"issue_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/issues/221\",\"number\":221,\"state\":\"open\",\"locked\":false,\"title\":\"Formalize Euclidean prescient mirror descent on the actual run\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"jicheng9617\",\"id\":74550583,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTUwNTgz\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74550583?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/jicheng9617\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"Specialize Orabona v10 Algorithm 15.8 / Theorem 15.30 to quadratic Euclidean geometry on the same actual partial prescient run. The new API proves the actual gradient and divergence identity, then both variable-step and fixed-step regret bounds with the full negative squared-movement term. The fixed-step proof left as an exercise is included.\\n\\nThe run conclusions are conditional on supplied feasible attained quadratic updates, with arbitrary EReal losses satisfying the audited global-support/domain/no-bottom premises. Scoring uses the updated point; the variable maximum uses previous states and the final played step. The fixed theorem permits T=0. Two nonaffine, top-outside-domain canaries consume both run and bound conjuncts of the respective new production theorem.\\n\\nThe shared Book mapping adds one coherent source-card group and three declaration-bound lessons. All 11,101 old registry objects and all old cards/lessons are preserved; three new canonical nodes are added. Source topology, selected actual VALUE parents and conceptual transport remain distinct. Mathlib dependency names remain visible in notes and compiled evidence; they are not invented as local registry nodes.\\n\\nValidation on source candidate `3b393adb009bc25a2c6e3fa3148bf9a3a2b4c376`:\\n\\n- Lean root: 9,123 jobs; Tests: 9,305 jobs.\\n- Full harness: 474 tests passed, 7 configured skips; only the three standard axioms in new declaration exports.\\n- Contributor contract, process memory, plain site preflight, Lean-verified build, official site check, structural preservation and isolated desktop reader capture all passed with unchanged RAW inputs and exact selected ZIP snapshots.\\n- Eight original screenshots and exact HTTP-to-local-page byte bindings are retained in `runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/final-validation-evidence-v1`.\\n\\nIndependent bounded FINAL acceptance is recorded in `runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/final-validation-evidence-v1/fresh-independent-final-review-v1.json` (SHA256 `50ebc5f41c81598692cd3bfc28aa058abeccdc9abfc60a9a6e34efb2bea21d24`); parent bounded acceptance is `60375da192caed9074400614a15ce1290d84a7a3af4f1614261cacbcef0484fe`. The bounded local Exposition Seal passed; purification remains pending. Historical failed proof attempts, evidence/transport repairs and the failed Mathlib-link site preflight are retained. The author optimality/global-support justification remains a source gap; the checked proximal implementation route does not erase it. Latest source-first governance was adopted incrementally after the legacy statement freeze: no retroactive preproof topology gate or native whole-loop acceptance is claimed.\\n\\nThis is stacked on #220. `main` at `fea256b1c03b14b79c6c84a965e8ac2b5a738f64` was merged into this branch. Only `later:lookahead/branch-03` is accepted locally; the prescient container and mandatory `repair:7.47-terminal` / `repair:15.31-terminal` remain open. Seven required Chapter 2 containers and six future mathematical claims remain open. Chapter 2 remains partial with a null complete proof denominator, and the Chapters 1–16 Goal remains ACTIVE. This PR does not update main or the live site; purification remains pending.\\n\\nDelivery commit: `2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6`. The later evidence commit preserves every active source input from the combined-gate candidate. CI status is tracked separately; local gates are not a GitHub CI verdict.\\n\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11T07:49:15Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11T07:49:15Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"merged_at\":null,\"merge_commit_sha\":\"ed02d6159d25d59aa05b02a77a09fce8d50f0017\",\"assignees\":[],\"requested_reviewers\":[],\"requested_teams\":[],\"labels\":[],\"milestone\":null,\"draft\":true,\"commits_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/221/commits\",\"review_comments_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/221/comments\",\"review_comment_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/Dake