%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2Fgit-PR-diff-paths.stderr.raw?ref=b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8"},{"sha":"d503022056208fdef5a836da2417cb43b9bef86a","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/actual-PR221-delivery-v1/git-PR-diff-paths.stdout.raw","status":"added","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changes":0,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2Fgit-PR-diff-paths.stdout.raw","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2Fgit-PR-diff-paths.stdout.raw","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2Fgit-PR-diff-paths.stdout.raw?ref=b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8"},{"sha":"2f6144d694903de324191f0a98045c5af02cd5d7","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/actual-PR221-delivery-v1/pr-body-v1.md","status":"added","additions":18,"deletions":0,"changes":18,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2Fpr-body-v1.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2Fpr-body-v1.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2Fpr-body-v1.md?ref=b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@\n+Specialize Orabona v10 Algorithm 15.8 / Theorem 15.30 to quadratic Euclidean geometry on the same actual partial prescient run. The new API proves the actual gradient and divergence identity, then both variable-step and fixed-step regret bounds with the full negative squared-movement term. The fixed-step proof left as an exercise is included.\n+\n+The run conclusions are conditional on supplied feasible attained quadratic updates, with arbitrary EReal losses satisfying the audited global-support/domain/no-bottom premises. Scoring uses the updated point; the variable maximum uses previous states and the final played step. The fixed theorem permits T=0. Two nonaffine, top-outside-domain canaries consume both run and bound conjuncts of the respective new production theorem.\n+\n+The shared Book mapping adds one coherent source-card group and three declaration-bound lessons. All 11,101 old registry objects and all old cards/lessons are preserved; three new canonical nodes are added. Source topology, selected actual VALUE parents and conceptual transport remain distinct. Mathlib dependency names remain visible in notes and compiled evidence; they are not invented as local registry nodes.\n+\n+Validation on source candidate `3b393adb009bc25a2c6e3fa3148bf9a3a2b4c376`:\n+\n+- Lean root: 9,123 jobs; Tests: 9,305 jobs.\n+- Full harness: 474 tests passed, 7 configured skips; only the three standard axioms in new declaration exports.\n+- Contributor contract, process memory, plain site preflight, Lean-verified build, official site check, structural preservation and isolated desktop reader capture all passed with unchanged RAW inputs and exact selected ZIP snapshots.\n+- Eight original screenshots and exact HTTP-to-local-page byte bindings are retained in `runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/final-validation-evidence-v1`.\n+\n+Independent bounded FINAL acceptance is recorded in `runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/final-validation-evidence-v1/fresh-independent-final-review-v1.json` (SHA256 `50ebc5f41c81598692cd3bfc28aa058abeccdc9abfc60a9a6e34efb2bea21d24`); parent bounded acceptance is `60375da192caed9074400614a15ce1290d84a7a3af4f1614261cacbcef0484fe`. The bounded local Exposition Seal passed; purification remains pending. Historical failed proof attempts, evidence/transport repairs and the failed Mathlib-link site preflight are retained. The author optimality/global-support justification remains a source gap; the checked proximal implementation route does not erase it. Latest source-first governance was adopted incrementally after the legacy statement freeze: no retroactive preproof topology gate or native whole-loop acceptance is claimed.\n+\n+This is stacked on #220. `main` at `fea256b1c03b14b79c6c84a965e8ac2b5a738f64` was merged into this branch. Only `later:lookahead/branch-03` is accepted locally; the prescient container and mandatory `repair:7.47-terminal` / `repair:15.31-terminal` remain open. Seven required Chapter 2 containers and six future mathematical claims remain open. Chapter 2 remains partial with a null complete proof denominator, and the Chapters 1–16 Goal remains ACTIVE. This PR does not update main or the live site; purification remains pending.\n+\n+Delivery commit: `2615db818eaca2e88b68d94f3b8a58519b65f5c6`. The later evidence commit preserves every active source input from the combined-gate candidate. CI status is tracked separately; local gates are not a GitHub CI verdict."},{"sha":"e8dbe117e5ceacd9c42f87cf614f03b0ebfcde23","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/actual-PR221-delivery-v1/push.receipt.json","status":"added","additions":15,"deletions":0,"changes":15,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2Fpush.receipt.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Factual-PR221-delivery-v1%2Fpush.receipt.json","contents_url":"https://api.git